[7372.9557, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m  GNU nano 8.7.1                                           README.md                                                    \u001b[1;119H\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\u001b[29d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^G\u001b(B\u001b[m Help\u001b[29;16H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^O\u001b(B\u001b[m Write Out   \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^F\u001b(B\u001b[m Where Is    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^K\u001b(B\u001b[m Cut\u001b[29;61H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^T\u001b(B\u001b[m Execute     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^C\u001b(B\u001b[m Location    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-U\u001b(B\u001b[m Undo\u001b[106G"]
[7372.956177, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-A\u001b(B\u001b[m Set Mark\r\u001b[30d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^X\u001b(B\u001b[m Exit\u001b[30;16H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^R\u001b(B\u001b[m Read File   \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^\\\u001b(B\u001b[m Replace     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^U\u001b(B\u001b[m Paste\u001b[61G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^J\u001b(B\u001b[m Justify     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^/\u001b(B\u001b[m Go To Line  \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-E\u001b(B\u001b[m Redo\u001b[106G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-6\u001b(B\u001b[m Copy"]
[7372.95645, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m# Evidence\r\u001b[4d\u001b[32m**Phase: All year**\r\u001b[6d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mThe text-native proof behind every claim in your portfolio. If you assert something, the proof lives here.\r\u001b[8d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## What belongs here\r\u001b[10d\u001b[35m- \u001b[36m`*.cast`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — asciinema recordings of terminal sessions.\r\u001b[11d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mscanner reports, log extracts, and pipeline run records, each named clearly by phase and date.\r\u001b[12d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mNothing here is a screenshot. If you are tempted to screenshot, capture the terminal output or the file instead.\r\u001b[14d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Evidence rule\r\u001b[16d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mEverything in this folder must be readable text: source files, transcripts, reports, or plain-language descriptions. No\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[2;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
