[7746.998143, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m#/ Build It Anywhere — Pair Project Repository\r\u001b[4d"]
[7746.998193, "o", "\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m/\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m**Cyber Sentinel Programme, Cohort 3, Year 2 — Hein Wagner Academy**\r\u001b[6d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mThis is your pair's project repository for the whole year. It \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m**is**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m your portfolio: everything you build, secure, and \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[8;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mReplace the placeholders below in your first Friday (Phase 1), then commit.\r\u001b[10d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m---\r\u001b[12d## Our pair\r\u001b[14d\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**Persona:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32m_Thusanang Microlending_\r\u001b[15d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**Student A:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32m_Yanga Tutshana_\r\u001b[16d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**Student B:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32m_Hattinie Freyer_\r\u001b[17d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**The platform in one paragraph:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32m_We are building a cloud architexture solution for Thusanang Microlending, a micro\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[19;1H"]
[7746.998427, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## How this repository is organised\r\u001b[21d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mEvery folder has its own \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m`README.md`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m explaining exactly what belongs in it. In order of the year:\r\u001b[23d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**charter/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — your project charter, business profile, and POPIA exposure assessment (Phase 1)\r\u001b[24d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**threat-model/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the threat model, versions 0 to 3, each kept (Phases 1 to 4)\r\u001b[25d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**architecture/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the Bicep design, identity model, control mapping, and Mermaid diagrams with written descriptions\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[26;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**infrastructure/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the OpenTofu definition and its plan output (Phase 3B onward)\r\u001b[27d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**hardening/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the Ansible playbook and Lynis before-and-after reports (Phase 3A)\r\u001b[2d\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
