[11408.867231, "o", "On branch phase-1-foundation\r\nYour branch is up to date with 'origin/phase-1-foundation'.\r\n\r\nChanges not staged for commit:\r\n  (use \"git add/rm <file>...\" to update what will be committed)\r\n  (use \"git restore <file>...\" to discard changes in working directory)\r\n\t\u001b[31mmodified:   README.md\u001b[m\r\n\t\u001b[31mdeleted:    README.md Thusanang Microlending is a microlending service dedicated to serve the community and expand our opirations.\u001b[m\r\n\t\u001b[31mmodified:   charter/charter.md\u001b[m\r\n\r\nUntracked files:\r\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to include in what will be committed)\r\n\t\u001b[31mcharter/business_profile.md\u001b[m\r\n\t\u001b[31mevidence/repository_commit.cast\u001b[m\r\n\t\u001b[31mevidence/ssh_keys.cast\u001b[m\r\n\t\u001b[31mevidence/toolchain_verification.cast\u001b[m\r\n"]
